        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Feb 2026 08:17:19 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.0: Breaking the Ice</h3>

<p>
  <strong>⚠️ Important Note:</strong> Due to essential internal changes in how
  Thaw manages menu bar items, your current icon positions will be reset to
  "Always Visible." I sincerely apologize for the inconvenience, but this manual
  re-adjustment is unavoidable to ensure future stability.
</p>

<hr />

<p><strong>Localization Support:</strong></p>
<p>
  Thaw is now available in 12 languages with 100% completion. A huge thank you
  to our community contributors:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Chinese (Simplified):</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/picpo">@PiCpo</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Chinese (Traditional):</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/7a6163">@7a6163</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Dutch:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/SeBr28">@SeBr28</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>French:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/UYTR5">@PipaCode</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>German:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/Mutzki13">@Mutzki13</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Hungarian:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/johnnybakucz">@johnnybakucz</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Indonesian:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/volcbs">@volcbs</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Italian:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/zichichi">@zichichi</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Korean:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/yurihan">@YuriHan</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Spanish:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/diazdesandi">@diazdesandi</a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Thai:</strong> by
    <a href="https://github.com/priesdelly">@priesdelly</a>
  </li>
</ul>

<hr />

<p><strong>Changes and Fixes:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Multi-Monitor Support:</strong> Improved app menu hiding logic to
    correctly account for screen edges and active menu bars across multiple
    monitors.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Ultra-wide Monitor Fix:</strong> Resolved an issue where menu bar
    items were incorrectly included in calculations, which previously caused
    "Hidden" and Always Hidden" items to appear incorrectly on the left side of
    ultra-wide screens.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Refined Notch Detection:</strong> Implemented
    <code>auxiliaryTopLeftArea</code> for more accurate notch detection and
    added an option to enable the IceBar only on displays with a notch.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Immediate UI Updates:</strong> Menubar shapes (split/full) now
    update instantly when settings are changed, eliminating the previous
    30-second delay.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Display-Specific Layouts:</strong> Fixed an issue where menu bar
    items from primary displays were incorrectly included in trailing path
    calculations for external monitors.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Performance Optimizations:</strong> Reduced CPU usage by debouncing
    image cache updates, adding polling delays, and skipping background timer
    tasks when panels are hidden.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Simplified Settings:</strong> Removed the redundant "temporary item
    delay" setting as the smart rehide logic now handles these cases
    automatically.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Thaw Bar Scaling Fix:</strong> Resolved a scaling issue in the Thaw
    Bar by clamping the menu bar content height and capping item height to
    ensure consistent rendering.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>New Interaction:</strong> Added the ability to double-click directly
    on the menu bar to reveal the "Always Hidden" section.
  </li>
</ul>
]]></description>
